Z||000012||AusFiero||09-06-2001||05:45 AM||||Your main image looks good but the page is over 220 K in size. You have a cable connection right? Many search engines would reject it and people with non cable connections wont be inclined to wait. Just telling you how it is as a designer of over 60 commercial websites. Your images can be scaled down without losing resolution. That will fix things up.<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/ausfiero1.gif">   <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A> | <A HREF="http://www.fieroshop.com.au" TARGET=_blank>Fiero Accessories</A>||202.139.20.3||reg||1
